{"ID":"20240205153656-wn03vab","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240205153656-wn03vab","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153656-wn03vab\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206093235-l2bd5iq\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205163536-a7q3cdu\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206093235-l2bd5iq\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:95,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:95\u0026#125;","title":"延胡索","type":"doc","updated":"20240830170210"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206093235-l2bd5iq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206093235-l2bd5iq","updated":"20240206093245"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产浙江。\n【性状】\t干燥块茎，呈不规则扁球形，直径1"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2cm，表面黄色或褐黄色，顶端中间有略凹陷的茎痕，底部或有疙瘩状凸起。质坚硬而脆，断面黄色，角质，有蜡样光泽。无臭，味苦。\n【性味】\t辛、苦，温。\n【功效】\t活血散瘀，行气止痛。主治胸痹心痛，胁肋、脘腹诸痛，头痛、腰痛、疝气痛、筋骨痛、痛经、经闭，产后瘀腹痛，跌打损伤。\n【炙品】\t醋延胡索：取净延胡索，用醋拌匀，浸润，至醋吸尽，置锅内用文火炒至微干，取出，放凉；或取净延胡索，加醋置锅内共煮，至醋吸净，烘干，取出，放凉 (每100斤延胡索，用醋20斤) 。引药入肝，增强理气止痛功效。\n酒延胡索：取净延胡索片或碎块，加黄酒拌匀，闷透，置锅内用文火加热，炒干，取出放凉。每100kg延胡索，黄酒20kg。增强活血功效。"}]},{"ID":"20240206093236-o2hmsyx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206093236-o2hmsyx","updated":"20240206093236"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206093236-7rp5vr6.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205163536-a7q3cdu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205163536-a7q3cdu","updated":"20240205163536"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"延胡索"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/延胡索-20240205163536-lrzlpa7.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240714084900-ge6h7zt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240714084900-ge6h7zt","updated":"20240714085201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 310px;","style":"width: 300px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"延胡索 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/延胡索 3-20240714085201-9o97mp1.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 300px;\" parent-style=\"width: 310px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 373px;","style":"width: 363px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"延胡索 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/延胡索 1-20240714084948-sm9j0v5.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 363px;\" parent-style=\"width: 373px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 334px;","style":"width: 324px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"延胡索 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/延胡索 2-20240714085052-qygzn1r.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 324px;\" parent-style=\"width: 334px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240714090155-v1j274w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240714090155-v1j274w","updated":"20240714090844"},"Children":[